; RFC 7519 §4.1.2 "sub" Claim.
;
; RFC 7519 defines sub as a StringOrURI like iss, but the
; iss_sub_test.go accept set includes "subject with space",
; "abc-XYZ_123.tilde~", and pure digit strings — i.e. sub is treated
; as an opaque issuer-chosen identifier that the library does not
; structurally validate. The only rule is non-empty (enforced by the
; caller before this regex is consulted) and printable.

sub            = 1*( %x20-7E )    ; any printable ASCII or space
